                                                "sense_id": "3f09f56e-313f-322c-a9e2-fd75df2120eb",
                                                "text": "1896, William Allen Sylvester, Modern Carpentry and Building, page 142, \"But, since we have increased the original value of 26 tenfold its original value, we must increase the original result tenfold : ten times 2 equal 20, the required answer.\""
                                            },
                                            {
